      "message": "Removing _param suffix on normative tagged text since this violates the naming scheme (parameters which are now called \"implementation-defined-behaviors\" are identified in the norm rule YAML file, not by adding metadata (i.e., _param) to a tag name or norm rule name.\n\nSigned-off-by: James Ball <jameball@qti.qualcomm.com>",
